ainbow␀␀␀Background␀␀Choose the colour␀␀␀Widgets, cards and panel tiles let the background show through. Off: solid tiles.␀␀␀Glass tiles␀Chat icons␀␀Names are always in colour; this colours the bubbles too.␀␀␀Colourful bubbles␀␀␀Compact messages (IRC style)␀␀␀␀Locking␀The touchscreen ignores taps until you unlock.␀␀Lock when screen off␀␀␀␀Off shows who wrote and how many, not what.␀Message text on lock screen␀PIN lock␀␀␀␀Asks for 4 numbers or letters to unlock, and locks whenever the screen goes off. If you forget it, the only way back in is to reset the device, which erases everything on it.␀␀Change PIN␀␀Export␀␀Export backup␀␀␀Off reuses meshcore-backup.json, the file name the MeshCore app uses.␀␀␀Append timestamp␀␀␀␀Saved to the SD card when one is in, otherwise to internal storage.␀Import backup␀␀␀Replaces identity, channels and contacts with the backup's, then restarts.␀␀Saved backups␀␀␀No backups yet. Use Export backup above to create one.␀␀Factory reset␀␀␀Erases identity, contacts, channels, messages, Wi-Fi and all settings, then reboots.␀␀␀␀Tap a language; the device reboots to apply.␀␀␀␀What each installed app is allowed to do. Anything an app sends goes out under your node name and cannot be told apart from a message you typed. Private covers direct messages and room posts, and is kept separate from channels on purpose. Turn one off to take it back.␀␀␀␀No apps installed.␀␀Post to channels as me␀␀Read channel messages␀␀␀Send private messages as me␀Read private messages␀␀␀Send discovery probes␀␀␀Not asked yet␀␀␀Keep holding: settings␀␀п”™  ␀␀␀пЂ‡  ␀␀␀пЃ№  ␀␀␀*  Unfav␀␀␀␀*  Favorite␀пЂЊ  Unblock␀␀␀␀пЃ№  Join␀␀␀пѓ   Open chat␀␀пЂ“  Admin␀␀пЂЎ  Ping␀␀␀пѓ   Message␀␀␀␀п‰Ѓ  Telemetry␀␀п„¤  Show on map␀␀␀␀п„¤  Hound␀␀п„¤  Trace SNR␀␀п‡«  Range test␀п„¤  Sightline␀␀пЊ„  Nickname␀␀␀п„¤  Stop sharing loc␀␀␀п„¤  Share my loc␀␀␀пЃ№  Reset path␀п‚“  Share contact␀␀Unfavorite it first␀Not in your contacts␀␀␀␀Self  %.4f, %.4f␀␀␀␀пѓ ␀Team: pick the team channel in Team > S